smb: client: port and use the wait_for_credits logic used by server

jira KERNEL-1677
Rebuild_History Non-Buildable kernel-5.14.0-687.52.1.el9_8
commit-author Stefan Metzmacher <metze@samba.org>
commit bb848d205f7ac0141af52a5acb6dd116d9b71177
Empty-Commit: Cherry-Pick Conflicts during history rebuild.
Will be included in final tarball splat. Ref for failed cherry-pick at:
ciq/ciq_backports/kernel-5.14.0-687.52.1.el9_8/bb848d20.failed

This simplifies the logic and prepares the use of
smbdirect_send_batch in order to make sure
all messages in a multi fragment send are grouped
together.

We'll add the smbdirect_send_batch processin
in a later patch.

